# Copy this file to .env and fill in your own Google OAuth Client ID to
# enable the "Continue with Google" button on Login/Signup.
#
# Get one at https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials
#   -> Create Credentials -> OAuth client ID -> Application type: Web application
#   -> Authorized JavaScript origins: http://localhost:5173 (dev)
#
# No client SECRET is needed here -- only the public client ID. Vite only
# exposes env vars prefixed with VITE_ to the browser bundle, and this one
# is safe to expose (OAuth client IDs are public by design, unlike secrets).
#
# If left unset, the Google Sign-In button simply doesn't render -- it's
# optional, not required for the rest of the app to work.
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
